  m_text: 'For Prototypers:


    Run into the capsule to take damage to see how
    the healing spell works

    Only three spells work at this time (Fireball, Whirlwind,
    and Healing)


    To cast spells, flip to the page using right click and type
    in the combination in the book. Then press left click to use the spell.


    Blue
    squares are targets for the spells.


    Use ESC to pause the game and press
    it again to leave the pause menu.'
